163	// settings enable checkpoints_version: 2 but the local repo has no v2 /main
164	// ref — i.e. migration was never run. We don't try to detect partial
165	// migrations: drift between v1 and v2 is acceptable post-migration and a
166	// strict cross-check is expensive on large repos.
